{
  "plan": {
    "version": "0.1",
    "title": "固定y与对x的偏导数：截线切线斜率",
    "goals": [
      "理解固定y=y₀的几何意义是选取固定截面",
      "掌握在截面内对x求一元导数得到对x的偏导数",
      "理解偏导数是截线在某点的切线斜率，而非直观旋转视角"
    ],
    "teaching_strategies": [
      "通过三维曲面与y=y₀截面建立几何直觉",
      "推导固定y₀后的截线方程，并投影到二维平面求切线",
      "对比说明特定点偏导数计算过程及其边界条件"
    ],
    "numbers": [
      {
        "initial": 0,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 2,
        "label": "y0",
        "student_control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.01
        }
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "purpose": "介绍固定y=y₀的几何意义及截面形成",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          },
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "visual",
            "capability": "function_surface_with_section"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "上一课我们固定了高度z。这一次，我们要研究求对x的偏导数：这就需要固定输入变量y等于一个常数y₀。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "visual",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "content": {
                  "capability": "function_surface_with_section",
                  "parameters": {
                    "title": "曲面 z = x² + y² 与截面 y = y₀",
                    "expression": "x^2 + y^2",
                    "section_axis": "y"
                  },
                  "numbers": [
                    1
                  ]
                },
                "role": "main_visual",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "new_region"
                },
                "reusable_item": 2
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "固定输入变量",
                  "items": [
                    "求对x的偏导数 ➔ 固定y = y₀",
                    "截面垂直于y轴"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "大家看，当y固定时，截面与曲面相交出一条截线。在这个截面内，y保持不变，只有x在变化，高度z随着x变化。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "引导观察截面与曲面的交线",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "我把y₀从0平移到1。请注意，平移截面只是在选择我们研究哪条曲线，旋转视角或移动截面本身并不是在求导。",
            "delivery": "careful",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 1,
                "duration_intent": "normal",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "推导截线方程并展示二维截面内的切线",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          },
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "visual",
            "capability": "function_plot"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "我把y₀从0调整到1。请注意，平移截面只是改变了我们选择研究的特定曲线，移动y₀本身绝不等于对x求导。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 1,
                "duration_intent": "normal",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "当固定y等于1时，原曲面方程转化为一元函数g(x)等于x平方加1。若我们在截面上取x₀等于1，就确定了空间点P(1, 1, 2)。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "visual",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "content": {
                  "capability": "function_plot",
                  "parameters": {
                    "title": "截面内截线与切线关系（纵轴为高度z）",
                    "x_label": "x",
                    "y_label": "z",
                    "curve_labels": [
                      "截线 z=x²+1",
                      "P处切线 z=2x"
                    ],
                    "expressions": [
                      "((x)^(2))+(1)",
                      "(2)*(x)"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "role": "main_visual",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "new_region"
                },
                "reusable_item": 2
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "g(x) = x^2 + 1 \\quad (y_0 = 1)"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "聚焦截线与切线图",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "local_board_item",
                  "moment": 2,
                  "item": 1
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "看右侧的二维截面图，此时纵轴代表高度z，横轴代表x。我们可以清晰看到截线z等于x平方加1，以及在x等于1处的切线z等于2x，两者在点(1, 2)完美相切。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ],
                "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
                "timing": "after_speech"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "给出偏导数公式定义与一般性边界反例",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "我们在二维截面上，对截线方程 $g(x) = x^2 + 1$ 求导，得到 $g'(x) = 2x$。在 $x=1$ 处，导数 $g'(1) = 2$。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "g'(x) = 2x \\implies g'(1) = 2"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "f_x(x_0, y_0) = \\lim_{\\Delta x \\to 0} \\frac{f(x_0 + \\Delta x, y_0) - f(x_0, y_0)}{\\Delta x} = 2x_0"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "推导截线在 x=1 处的切线斜率",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "结合切点 $(1, 2)$，利用点斜式得到切线方程 $z - 2 = 2(x - 1)$，即 $z = 2x$。请注意，这里的斜率 2 代表高度增量与 $x$ 增量之比，绝非屏幕上肉眼看到的像素倾斜角度。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "明确切线斜率的几何与物理意义",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "reusable",
                  "section": 2,
                  "item": 2
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "写成偏导数的一般形式，在 $(x_0, y_0)$ 处的偏导数为 $f_x(x_0, y_0) = 2x_0$。这里斜率与 $y_0$ 无关，只是 $f(x,y)=x^2+y^2$ 的特殊性质；比如当 $f(x,y)=xy$ 时，偏导数 $f_x = y$ 就与 $y$ 密切相关。",
            "delivery": "careful",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "给出偏导数一般表达并说明结论边界",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "总结截线偏导概念并提出反求y₀的检验问题",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "总结一下：多元函数中固定y等于y零，实质上是将曲面截成一维截线，在该截面上对x求一元导数，其几何意义就是截线在指定点的切线斜率。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "总结固定变量与截线切线斜率的关系",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 3,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "请思考便签上的检查问题：如果在点P(1,1,2)处要求对y的偏导数，我们应该固定哪个变量呢？显然，我们需要固定的是x=1。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "偏导数截面总结与思考",
                  "items": [
                    "固定 y = y₀：沿 x 方向变化，求对 x 的偏导数 ∂z/∂x",
                    "固定 x = x₀：沿 y 方向变化，求对 y 的偏导数 ∂z/∂y",
                    "思考：若在 P(1,1,2) 求 ∂z/∂y，应固定 x = 1",
                    "课后验证：固定 x = 1，寻找使 z = 2 的非负 y₀"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 3,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "课后请大家完成一个反向验证练习：在固定x=1的前提下，要使曲面上的点高度z等于2，请在非负范围内调节y零的值并观察截面的变化。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ],
                "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
                "timing": "after_speech"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "close": {
      "summary": "本课学习了固定y=y₀截面下的截线，以及其在某点对x的偏导数即为截线切线的斜率。",
